-- An employer may ask about a listed question (s 26.1(1)).
#ASSERT `As an employer, can I ask the Canada Revenue Agency for a ruling (s 26.1(1))` TRUE
-- A question the Act does not list.
#ASSERT NOT (`As an employer, can I ask the Canada Revenue Agency for a ruling (s 26.1(1))` FALSE)

