-- Not to verify compliance.
#ASSERT NOT (`May a judge authorize the Minister to require information about unnamed persons from me (s 25(7))` TRUE TRUE FALSE)

-- Must the judge's authorization be served on me together with the Minister's notice (s 25(8))
-- Served with the notice (s 25(8)).
