-- May the Minister refund the excess deducted from my pay over what section 8 requires (s 38(3))
-- Applied in time and the Minister is satisfied (s 38(3)).
#ASSERT `May the Minister refund the excess deducted from my pay over what section 8 requires (s 38(3))` TRUE TRUE 2024 (YMD 2028 12 31) FALSE (YMD 2010 1 1)
-- The Minister is not satisfied.
