-- Neither.
#ASSERT NOT (`Am I guilty of an offence if I do not keep records or I contravene section 25 (s 41(2))` FALSE FALSE)

-- What is the most the court may fine me for an offence under subsection 41(2) (s 41(2))
-- The Act names no maximum for this offence (explicit not-covered value).
